{
  "id": 8833330806983,
  "title": "Fantasy Winged Dragon Quilt Set with Volcanic Eruption And Bedroom",
  "handle": "fantasy-winged-dragon-comforter-set-with-volcanic-eruption-and-bedroom-258009c125-258009c125",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring a touch of legendary wonder into your bedroom with this stunning custom dragon bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring a captivating winged dragon fantasy design, this soft and breathable bedding set is perfect for kids, boys, girls, teens, and all animal lovers who want to add a unique, magical theme to their room decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this dragon bedding set with your own name or custom text input for a truly unique look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fictional Fantasy Theme:</strong> Decorated with a beautiful digital fantasy illustration of a winged dragon amidst a volcanic eruption, flowing lava, and fiery skies.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Softness:</strong> Crafted from a high-quality microfiber and cotton-polyester blend, offering a soft, breathable, and cozy experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from several sizes to fit your bed perfectly, including Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, and King.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This bedding set is machine washable and tumble dryable, making maintenance hassle-free.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customized Set Options:</strong> Choose your preferred quilt size and select the quantity of matching pillowcases to complete your customized set.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Cotton-Polyester Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Dragon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Galaxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Dragon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragon Quilt D9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Washable and Tumble Dryable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
